From: OpenWrt <openwrt@openwrt.org>
Subject: [PATCH] ralink: mdio: use phy_attach_direct for Linux 7.3

phy_attach() was removed in 7.3. Use phy_attach_direct() with the
existing phydev and MII interface.

Signed-off-by: OpenWrt <openwrt@openwrt.org>

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/ralink/mdio.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/ralink/mdio.c
@@ -105,7 +105,7 @@
 
 static void phy_init(struct fe_priv *priv, struct phy_device *phy)
 {
-	phy_attach(priv->netdev, dev_name(&phy->mdio.dev), PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_MII);
+	phy_attach_direct(priv->netdev, phy, 0, PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_MII);
 
 	phy->autoneg = AUTONEG_ENABLE;
 	phy->speed = 0;
